@startuml Event_Detection_Detail

!include ../../includes/common_styling.puml

title Phase 2: Event Detection Detail

participant "Master\nAlgorithm" as Master
participant "Event Source" as Src1 #LightBlue

note over Master
    **Input:** [t_left, t_right]
    **Goal:** Detect if events occur in interval
    **Method:** Speculative trial step + rollback
end note

note over Master
    **Initialize data structures:**
    snapshots = {}
    input_cache = {}
    indicators_left = {}
    crossings = []
end note

== Loop: For Each Event Source ==

group #E8F8F5 Event Source 1 Detection

    Master -> Src1: **1. Snapshot state** at t_left
    activate Src1
    Src1 -> Src1: snapshot_state()

    Src1 --> Master: snapshots[Src1] = snapshot
    deactivate Src1
    
    Master -> Src1: **2. Capture inputs** at t_left
    activate Src1

    Src1 --> Master: input_cache[Src1] = {port: value, ...}
    deactivate Src1
    
    Master -> Src1: **3. Evaluate indicators** at t_left
    activate Src1
    Src1 -> Src1: evaluate_event_indicators()
    note right of Src1
        **For each registered indicator:**
        g_i(x(t_left)) = func(component)
    end note
    Src1 --> Master: indicators_left[Src1] = {event_name: value, ...}
    deactivate Src1
    
    Master -> Src1: **4. Trial step** to t_right
    activate Src1
    note over Master, Src1 #FFCCCC
        **Speculative Evaluation:** This step modifies component state
    end note
    
    Src1 -> Src1: _do_step_internal(t_left, dt)
    
    Src1 -> Src1: _update_output_states()
    
    Src1 -> Src1: evaluate_event_indicators()
    Src1 --> Master: indicators_right = {event_name: value, ...}
    deactivate Src1
    
    Master -> Master: **5. Detect zero-crossings**
    note over Master
        **Zero-Crossing Detection:**
        For each indicator g_i:
        
        prev_sign = sign(indicators_left[i], tol=1e-10)
        curr_sign = sign(indicators_right[i], tol=1e-10)
        
        **Direction-sensitive:**
        - direction=0:  any crossing (prev ≠ curr)
        - direction=+1: rising edge (prev < 0, curr ≥ 0)
        - direction=-1: falling edge (prev > 0, curr ≤ 0)
        
        **Record if crossing detected:**
        crossings.append((Src1, event_name))
    end note
    
    Master -> Src1: **6. Restore state** to t_left
    activate Src1
    note over Master, Src1 #CCFFCC
        **Rollback Required:**
        Undo speculative step to prepare
        for next phase (bisection or normal step)
    end note
    
    Src1 -> Src1: restore_state(snapshot, t_left)
    note right of Src1        
        **Guarantees:**
        Subsequent do_step(t_left, dt)
        behaves as if trial step
        never occurred
    end note
    
    Src1 -> Src1: set_inputs(input_cache[Src1], t_left)
    note right of Src1
        **Input restoration:**
        Ensures component sees
        same inputs as before
        trial step
    end note
    
    Src1 --> Master: restored to t_left
    deactivate Src1

end group

== Detection Result ==

Master -> Master: **Collect all crossings**
note over Master
    **Return values:**
    - snapshots: {comp_name: state, ...}
    - input_cache: {comp_name: {port: value, ...}, ...}
    - indicators_left: {comp_name: {event: g_i, ...}, ...}
    - crossings: [(comp_name, event_name), ...]
    
    **Examples:**
    crossings = [
        ("Pendulum", "wall_hit"),
        ("Source_1", "zero_crossing")
    ]
end note

alt crossings is empty
    note over Master #Technology
        **No events detected:**
        Proceed to Gauss-Seidel step
        for entire interval [t_left, t_right]
    end note
else crossings detected
    note over Master #LightCoral
        **Events detected:**
        Proceed to Phase 3 (Bisection)
        to localize event time
    end note
end

@enduml